{"seq":2,"slug":"permutations-combinations","title":"排列与组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/permutations-combinations","wordCount":1522,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"排列与组合\">排列与组合</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>排列（Permutation）和组合（Combination）是计数问题中最核心的两个模型。排列关注<strong>有序选择</strong>——选出的元素按顺序排列；组合关注<strong>无序选择</strong>——只关心选出了哪些元素，不关心顺序。</p>\n<p>在算法设计中，排列对应&quot;搜索所有可能的排列顺序&quot;（如旅行商问题），组合对应&quot;搜索所有可能的子集&quot;（如背包问题）。两者的计数公式决定了暴力搜索的时间复杂度，因此理解它们的数学性质对于评估算法可行性至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[选择问题]&#10;    A --&gt; B{是否考虑顺序?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[排列]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[组合]&#10;    C --&gt; E{是否允许重复?}&#10;    D --&gt; F{是否允许重复?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;P(n,r) = n!/(n-r)!&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| H[&quot;nʳ&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| I[&quot;C(n,r) = n!/(r!(n-r)!)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| J[&quot;C(n+r-1,r)&quot;]\">graph TB\n    A[选择问题]\n    A --&gt; B{是否考虑顺序?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[排列]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[组合]\n    C --&gt; E{是否允许重复?}\n    D --&gt; F{是否允许重复?}\n    E --&gt;|否| G[\"P(n,r) = n!/(n-r)!\"]\n    E --&gt;|是| H[\"nʳ\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| I[\"C(n,r) = n!/(r!(n-r)!)\"]\n    F --&gt;|是| J[\"C(n+r-1,r)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择模型</th>\n<th>有序</th>\n<th>可重复</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>排列</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>P(n,r) = n!/(n-r)!</td>\n<td>选 3 人排名次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重复排列</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>nʳ</td>\n<td>r 位密码（n 种字符）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>C(n,r) = n!/(r!(n-r)!)</td>\n<td>选 3 人组成委员会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重复组合</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>C(n+r-1,r)</td>\n<td>n 种水果取 r 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全排列</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>n!</td>\n<td>n 人排成一列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"排列数与阶乘\">排列数与阶乘</h2><p><strong>排列数</strong> P(n, r)（也写作 A(n, r)）表示从 n 个不同元素中选 r 个进行有序排列的方案数。第一个位置有 n 种选择，第二个位置有 n-1 种，...，第 r 个位置有 n-r+1 种。根据乘法原理：</p>\n<p>P(n, r) = n × (n-1) × ... × (n-r+1) = n! / (n-r)!</p>\n<p><strong>阶乘</strong> n! = n × (n-1) × ... × 2 × 1 增长极快。Stirling 近似给出了阶乘的渐近估计：n! ≈ √(2πn) × (n/e)ⁿ。这个近似在分析大规模排列问题时非常有用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>n</th>\n<th>n!</th>\n<th>量级</th>\n<th>暴力搜索可行性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>~10²</td>\n<td>微秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>3,628,800</td>\n<td>~10⁶</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>1.3 × 10¹²</td>\n<td>~10¹²</td>\n<td>分钟到小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>2.4 × 10¹⁸</td>\n<td>~10¹⁸</td>\n<td>不可行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>3.0 × 10⁶⁴</td>\n<td>~10⁶⁴</td>\n<td>宇宙都不够</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function factorial(n: number): bigint {&#10;  let result = 1n;&#10;  for (let i = 2n; i &lt;= BigInt(n); i++) {&#10;    result *= i;&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function permutations(n: number, r: number): bigint {&#10;  return factorial(n) / factorial(n - r);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BigInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n); i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> permutations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>全排列的生成是许多算法问题的基础。<strong>Heap 算法</strong>以 O(n!) 的最优时间生成所有排列，每次只交换两个元素。<strong>字典序排列生成</strong>按照字典顺序依次产生下一个排列，<code>next_permutation</code> 是 C++ STL 中的标准函数。</p>\n<p>在实际应用中，生成排列的效率至关重要。回溯法生成排列的时间复杂度为 O(n × n!)（每个排列花 O(n) 时间输出），而 Heap 算法只需 O(n!) 时间（每个排列仅一次交换）。当 n 较大时，这个常数因子差异很显著。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function* heapPermutation&lt;T&gt;(arr: T[], size: number = arr.length): Generator&lt;T[]&gt; {&#10;  if (size === 1) {&#10;    yield [...arr];&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; size; i++) {&#10;    yield* heapPermutation(arr, size - 1);&#10;    const swapIdx = size % 2 === 0 ? i : 0;&#10;    [arr[swapIdx], arr[size - 1]] = [arr[size - 1], arr[swapIdx]];&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> heapPermutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Generator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arr];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> size; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    yield*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> heapPermutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arr, size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> swapIdx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [arr[swapIdx], arr[size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [arr[size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], arr[swapIdx]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"组合数与二项式系数\">组合数与二项式系数</h2><p><strong>组合数</strong> C(n, r)（也写作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{n}{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7454em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）表示从 n 个不同元素中选 r 个的无序选择方案数。由除法原理，C(n, r) = P(n, r) / r! = n! / (r! × (n-r)!)。</p>\n<p>组合数有许多重要性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对称性</strong>：C(n, r) = C(n, n-r)（选 r 个等于不选 n-r 个）</li>\n<li><strong>帕斯卡恒等式</strong>：C(n, r) = C(n-1, r-1) + C(n-1, r)</li>\n<li><strong>求和公式</strong>：∑ C(n, r) = 2ⁿ（n 个元素的子集总数）</li>\n<li><strong>朱世杰恒等式</strong>：∑ₖ C(k, r) = C(n+1, r+1)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>帕斯卡恒等式的组合解释：从 n 个元素中选 r 个，可以分为两类——包含第 n 个元素（从前 n-1 个中选 r-1 个）和不包含第 n 个元素（从前 n-1 个中选 r 个）。这直接对应递归子问题的分解。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function combinations(n: number, r: number): bigint {&#10;  if (r &gt; n) return 0n;&#10;  if (r === 0 || r === n) return 1n;&#10;  return combinations(n - 1, r - 1) + combinations(n - 1, r);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function combinationsDP(n: number, r: number): number {&#10;  const dp: number[][] = Array.from({ length: n + 1 }, () =&gt; new Array(r + 1).fill(0));&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    dp[i][0] = 1;&#10;    for (let j = 1; j &lt;= Math.min(i, r); j++) {&#10;      dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1] + dp[i - 1][j];&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return dp[n][r];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> combinations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F